#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:2
msgid "Connecting to the WiFi"
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:4
msgid "Power on the Solar Flare Alert. After a few seconds, the LED will begin blinking."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:6
msgid "If the blinking **stops after a few seconds**, the device has successfully connected to a previously saved WiFi network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:8
msgid "If the LED **continues blinking**, open the WiFi settings on your phone or computer and connect to the access point named **WifiManager**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:10
msgid "The phone should show a sign-in page. If it does not, open a web browser on the phone and type ``http://192.168.4.1`` in the address field. Stay on **WifiManager** while that page loads. If it still does not open, turn mobile data off and try again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:19
msgid "Earlier lamps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:21
msgid "Lamps sold before this setup page was updated do not show a sign-in window. The phone can be connected to the lamp while the browser still cannot open the page. Try the following once."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:23
msgid "Watch the LED. If it **stops blinking**, the lamp has already joined a saved network. Reconnect your phone to your home Wi-Fi. Nothing else is required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:25
msgid "If the LED **keeps blinking**, join the Wi-Fi network **WifiManager**. It is an open network and has no password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:27
msgid "Turn mobile data off, and stay on **WifiManager** when the phone says the network has no internet. Otherwise the phone sends the address through the mobile network, and the lamp never sees it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:29
msgid "On the phone, open a web browser and type ``http://192.168.4.1`` in the address field. Keep the ``http://``. Typing the number into a search box does not reach the lamp."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:31
msgid "If the page does not load, turn the lamp off, wait ten seconds, turn it on, and repeat from step 2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:33
msgid "If the page is still blank, stop retrying. On these lamps the setup program accepts the Wi-Fi connection and then does not answer, whether the browser is on a phone or a computer. The lamp needs the updated setup program (``wifi_manager.py``) before it can be joined to a new network. A network it has already saved keeps working."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:12
msgid "Select your home WiFi network from the list and enter the password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:14
msgid "The device will reboot and attempt to join your network. When the LED turns solid green, the connection was successful."
msgstr ""

#: ../../wifi_connection.rst:16
msgid "You're done. Reconnect your phone or computer to your normal WiFi. The Solar Flare Alert will now display the Sun’s current activity level."
msgstr ""
